,
,Use Grid
,**
,**
,Update V8.0 start
Displayset, #swapglidescharge=[-25], ....Charge for Swapping Undermount for Sidemount (use for predesigned jewelry drawers)
,Update V8.0 end
,,**            ***** Go back to A-Setup to change the method of pricing Drawer Boxes *****
,,**


,**  SECTION 1 Drawer Box Cost

,**

,DisplaySet,#DrawerboxType0=No Drawer Boxes,              Drawer Box Type 0 Name
,DisplaySet,#DrawerboxCost0=0,1.0        #DrawerboxType0 Cost 

,DisplaySet,#DrawerboxMultiplierCost0=0,1.0       #DrawerboxType0 Multiplier When you use MaterialCostGroup this will factor for your current material multiplier

DisplaySet,#DrawerboxType1=Matching Melamine Sidemount,              Drawer Box Type 1 Name
DisplaySet,#DrawerboxCost1=165,1.1         #DrawerboxType1 Cost 

DisplaySet,#DrawerboxMultiplierCost1=#MaterialCostGroup,1.1b       #DrawerboxType1 Multiplier When you use MaterialCostGroup this will factor for your current material multiplier
,**

